{"id":"wb-4-144","name":"东山关帝庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"东山关帝庙","text":"东山关帝庙，是中国福建省东山县铜陵镇岵嵝山东麓的关帝庙，又常称为铜陵关帝庙、铜陵武庙，是台湾众多关帝庙分香分灵入台的祖庙。1996年被列为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。\n东山关帝庙始建于明洪武二十年（1387年），扩建于正德三年（1508年），清康熙十九年（1680年）重建。整体建筑坐西北朝东南，中轴线上有牌楼、中殿、主殿等建筑，占地面积680平方米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%9C%E5%B1%B1%E5%85%B3%E5%B8%9D%E5%BA%99","revisionId":94898207,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94898207","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/dc9ce962eb7b602702a59c0d.jpg","title":"20230203_Temple_of_Guan_Yu,_Dongshan_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20230203_Temple_of_Guan_Yu,_Dongshan_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/47/20230203_Temple_of_Guan_Yu%2C_Dongshan_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Temple of Guan Yu, Dongshan","width":320,"height":213}}